WEBVTT

00:00:29.958 --> 00:00:31.601
yakifutwa,

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:33.667
ikiyaacha katika hali ya kutojulikana

00:00:35.417 --> 00:00:39.125
Inaonekana kama vile watu hawakuweza
kujenga vitu hivi,

00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:41.875
kwa sababu watu hawakujenga.

00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:47.101
Vilitengenezwa kwa uangalifu na 
jamii ya majitu

00:00:47.125 --> 00:00:48.393
yajulikanayo kama Cyclops.

00:00:48.417 --> 00:00:49.726
(Vicheko)

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:51.976
Na nimekuwa nashirikiana na
majitu haya

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.250
ili kujifunza siri zao
za kuhamisha mawe hayo makubwa.


00:00:56.667 --> 00:01:00.167
na ni kwamba,
Cyclops hawana nguvu kivile,